;; Larry Koopa's airship cabin (0.5.0, SMB3 style, after the owner's reference of SMB3's cabin):
;; enclosed, no sky. A hull ceiling across the top (`%`), thick hull pillars two tiles wide at the
;; left and right, the log back wall (`H`, not solid) with two porthole windows, a floor of log
;; posts (`#`) and one raised post. In the campaign 4-2's right warp-zone pipe leads here
;; (`4-2-airship 2 12`, level/campaign.ts): the hero rises out of the pipe in the floor at the left.
;; Larry hops at the hero, fires wand blasts and spins in his shell when stomped; beaten, he drops
;; the crystal ball, whose touch is 4-2's secret exit `secret:larry` (docs/HEROES.md).
;; Decor from the smb3 sheet: `porthole` (bottom-left tile) and `pillar` (each pillar's
;; bottom-left tile, on the floor row's top; a frame drawn over the two hull columns).
